# Arch AUR package metadata for openjiuwen-server

These PKGBUILD + systemd unit + sysusers + tmpfiles + install-hook files
are released under the [0BSD license](https://spdx.org/licenses/0BSD.html),
matching the convention of the AUR repo itself.

The packaged upstream software (openJiuwen Studio backend) is Apache-2.0
licensed; see `/usr/share/licenses/openjiuwen-server/LICENSE` after install.